{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.14,
   "end": 7.08,
   "text": "I lost $60,000 lending money to a house flipper, and it wasn't because the flip was bad."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.02,
   "end": 10.78,
   "text": "It's because one document I didn't have."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.92,
   "end": 16.82,
   "text": "By 2021, I'd already done three deals with this flipper, and I even brought my family"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.82,
   "end": 17.72,
   "text": "into two of them."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.18,
   "end": 21.44,
   "text": "We're making 20% returns in less than three, four months."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.96,
   "end": 22.7,
   "text": "Everything was great."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.26,
   "end": 25.88,
   "text": "Then in 2022, she wanted to go after a bigger flip."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.88,
   "end": 31.06,
   "text": "I ran the comps, the numbers looked good, and the deal was solid, but midway through"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.06,
   "end": 34.1,
   "text": "the project, something happened that nobody foresaw."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.94,
   "end": 41.88,
   "text": "Interest rates nearly doubled, from around 3.5% to 7%, and that luxury property sat in"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.88,
   "end": 46.2,
   "text": "the market for over a year, with the profit getting squeezed to almost nothing."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.1,
   "end": 48.14,
   "text": "Here's the real mistake."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.66,
   "end": 54.88,
   "text": "When we lent the money, we wired it directly to her and had a promissory note signed, instead"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.88,
   "end": 59.98,
   "text": "of sending it through the title company and recording a lien as a second mortgage on the"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.98,
   "end": 60.76,
   "text": "property itself."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.82,
   "end": 67.2,
   "text": "So when she finally sold it, she kept the proceeds, paid back none of her private lenders,"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.7,
   "end": 69.26,
   "text": "and left the state."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.46,
   "end": 77.46,
   "text": "Now we're paying lawyers to chase those funds and try to recoup it, but today I do it"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.46,
   "end": 78.18,
   "text": "completely different."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.78,
   "end": 80.66,
   "text": "I just lent to a private money."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.68,
   "end": 86.98,
   "text": "I just lent private money to another investor this time, and everything went through the attorneys,"
  },
  {
   "start": 87.34,
   "end": 89.98,
   "text": "signed and notarized with the lien recorder on the property."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.56,
   "end": 95.86,
   "text": "If they don't perform, we can foreclose and take that property, or when they sell it,"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.16,
   "end": 100.1,
   "text": "the closing proceeds go to pay off the mortgage as well as us first."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.66,
   "end": 101.4,
   "text": "No compromise."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.94,
   "end": 103.9,
   "text": "It's not based on a promise or a handshake."
  },
  {
   "start": 104.46,
   "end": 108.96,
   "text": "If you want to work with real estate agents who are actually investors that make mistakes"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.96,
   "end": 114.52,
   "text": "themselves and learn from them, not just peaches and rainbow, comment the word."
  },
  {
   "start": 116.52,
   "end": 121.56,
   "text": "If you want to work with agents that are also investors themselves that make mistakes and"
  },
  {
   "start": 121.56,
   "end": 127.3,
   "text": "learn from them and get better each day, comment the word call, C-A-L-L, down below,"
  },
  {
   "start": 127.72,
   "end": 130.12,
   "text": "and we will send you a link to Schedule a Call."
  }
 ],
